        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "selection_reason": "Plan 1 creates competition across price, workflow and seller confidence while requesting the missing grinder that could make Bambino useful. It preserves all first-round options and makes higher spending depend on practical user benefits rather than the available budget.",
  "limitations": [
    "Final replies are independent and revenue-motivated; requested comparisons or additional offers are not guaranteed.",
    "Forwarded claims remain fallible, and existing facts may not resolve seller, variant or accessory uncertainty.",
    "No catalog beyond the observed offers is known. Budget headroom does not constitute an available accessory offer."
  ]
